      "settlementKey": "thalryss:Abyrros",
      "description": "Dara Hubbell is a Star Elf cult leader whose faith in the heavens sounds ridiculous until her followers start producing maps, omens, and ritual mathematics that should not work. From the Abyrros Tavern, she leads a small star-seeking movement inside the Nefaric Veil, offering initiation, cosmic explanations, and expensive routes toward promised transcendence. She is earnest, manipulative, visionary, and never entirely easy to dismiss, especially under a sky where the Star-River answers back.",
      "settlementAndAncestryTexture": "Abyrros is a Town in Thalryss, under Protectorate, with high danger, Ocean Surface floating settlement terrain. Local records favor Neutral, Lawful, Cooperative, Honorable civic habits; common communities include Human, Halfling — Lightfoot Halfling, Elf — Sea Elf, Tortle, Genasi — Water Genasi. Star Elf reads through the Elf entry of the race compendium, within Elf Parent Race and Elf Bloodlines, marked by Sigrananna. Elves are long-lived, graceful beings deeply attuned to magic, nature, and art. Their societies often value tradition, beauty, and refined mastery of specialized skills. They are broadly divided across many cultural a. Table cues: Darkvision, Elven Lineage, Fey Ancestry, Keen Senses; starting tendency Altruistic - Lawful - Cooperative - Honorable.",
